<title>UK: UK clears planned JIB -Lloyd Thompson merger.</title>
<headline>UK clears planned JIB -Lloyd Thompson merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry on Thursday cleared the 300 million stg agreed merger between insurance broker Lloyd Thompson Group Plc and JIB Group Plc.</p>
<p>The DTI said in a statement it would not refer the merger to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>The department also cleared Victory Railway Holdings Ltd's acquisition of Thames Trains from the British Railways Board.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
